$$\text{m}\cdot\text{K/W}$$
$$R'_{ext} = 0,03516$$
$$\text{m}\cdot\text{K/W}$$
$$R'_{total} = 0,0485$$
$$\text{m}\cdot\text{K/W}$$
$$q' = 2721$$
$$\text{W/m}$$

