**Paso 1:
Circuito**
Tres nodos de
radiosidad:
$$J_1, J_2, J_3$$
Tres nodos de
potencia:
$$E_{b1}, E_{b2}, E_{b3}$$
Nodo 3 es
rerradiante:
$$q_3 = 0$$
$$E_{b3} = J_3$$

**Paso 2:
Áreas**
$$A_1 = 10,5$$
$$\text{m}^2$$
$$A_2 = 10,5$$
$$\text{m}^2$$
Factores:
$$\frac{L_1}{D} = 0,78$$
$$\frac{L_2}{D} = 0,67$$
$$F_{12} = 0,125$$
$$F_{13} = 0,875$$
$$F_{23} = 0,875$$

**Paso 3:
Resistencias**
$$R_{s1} = 0,06349$$
$$\text{m}^{-2}$$
$$R_{s2} = 0,02381$$
$$\text{m}^{-2}$$
$$R_{12} = 0,7619$$
$$\text{m}^{-2}$$
$$R_{13} = 0,1088$$
$$\text{m}^{-2}$$
$$R_{23} = 0,1088$$
$$\text{m}^{-2}$$

**Paso 4: Calor**
$$R_{geom} = 0,1693$$
$$\text{m}^{-2}$$
$$R_{eq} = 0,2566$$
$$\text{m}^{-2}$$
